quran[9]{c,v,t}:
  30,16,"While those who disbelieved and denied Our signs and the meeting of the Hereafter, they shall be brought to punishment."
  30,17,So glorify Allah when you enter the evening and rise in the morning.
  30,18,"And to Him belongs all praise in the heavens and the earth, and at nightfall and when you are in the late afternoon."
  30,19,"He brings the living out of the dead and brings the dead out of the living. And He gives life to the earth after its death. Likewise, you (too) shall be raised (from the dead)."
  30,20,"Among His signs is that He created you from dust. Then, behold, you are humans scattered (all over the world)."
  30,21,"And among His signs is that He created spouses for you from yourselves so that you may find comfort in them. And He established love and compassion between you. Indeed, there are signs in this for people who reflect."
  30,22,"And among His signs is the creation of the heavens and the earth, and the diversity of your languages and colours. There are indeed signs in this for the knowledgeable."
  30,23,"And among His signs is your sleep by night and day, and your pursuit of His grace. There are indeed signs in this for people who listen."
  30,24,"And among His signs is that He shows you lightning, arousing fear and hope. And He sends water down from the sky. Then He revives the earth after its death. There are indeed signs in it for people who apply reason."
